        app.set("veiw engine" , "ejs");        
-->
<!-- 

Create the Dynamic Template (views/index.ejs)

In your template file, you write standard HTML, but you can inject data using specialized EJS tags:
• <%= %> outputs the evaluated value into the HTML (escaped).
• <% %> executes control flow operations like loops or conditionals without printing anything directly. -->